This directory is a maintained fork, not a mirror. Every skills/*/SKILL.md
entrypoint is rewritten here: descriptions are shortened for the automatic skill
listing, upstream `allowed-tools` are moved to `metadata.upstream` so the host
does not pre-approve tools, and rarely used library skills are hidden with
`disable-model-invocation: true`. Files other than SKILL.md are unchanged,
except as noted below.

Excluded: EVALUATIONS.md, upstream's 0.9 MB evaluation log. README.md links to
it at the commit above instead of the missing local copy.

To refresh: diff everything except skills/*/SKILL.md against the commit above,
apply upstream changes, then re-apply the entrypoint rewrites and the
EVALUATIONS.md exclusion above, and update this file.
